.Dd July 17, 2026
.Dt RETICULUM-GO-SELF-CHECK 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm reticulum-go-self-check , rgoselfcheck
.Nd host OS preflight checklist
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm reticulum-go Cm self-check
.Op Fl binary Ar path
.Op Fl quick
.Op Fl full
.Op Fl interop
.Op Fl json
.Op Fl strict
.Op Fl timeout Ar duration
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Runs a host preflight checklist for
.Nm reticulum-go
(platform, binaries, optional interface and interop probes).
.Pp
.Fl quick
limits checks to core and platform.
.Fl full
includes optional interface probes.
.Fl interop
includes optional external tool checks.
.Fl strict
treats warnings as failures.
.Pp
Run with
.Fl h
for the full flag list.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr reticulum-go 1 ,
.Xr reticulum-go 8
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Quad4.io
